                                                }
                                },
                                {
                                    "flavor_text":  "Whenever PIKACHU comes across\nsomething new, it blasts it with a jolt\nof electricity.\fIf you come across a blackened berry,\nit’s evidence that this POKéMON\nmistook the intensity of its charge.",
